    12→
    13→A logging facade provides a single logging API that abstracts over the actual
    14→logging implementation. Libraries can use the logging API provided by this
    15→crate, and the consumer of those libraries can choose the logging
    19→## Minimum supported `rustc`
    25→## Usage
    27→### In libraries
    58→### In executables
